notes.content:
[b]【Alt+Enter】can play the game in full screen[/b]

[b]Modifications and updates[/b]
1.Fixed some text errors;
2.Fixed the judgment error of triggering the ending;

[b]Known some bugs (not yet fixed)[/b]
1.The dialogue content may be stuck, triggered in different places or repeatedly;
2.The screen may be torn or stuck;
3.After completing the game, the screen flickers when setting the resolution;
4.Game updates may cause prop map errors in existing processes

If you encounter the above bugs or game stucks, you can solve them by [u]restarting the game[/u] or [u]avoiding fast operations[/u].

If there are still other bugs, feedback or any game-related issues, you can get feedback in the following ways.

Our Discord: https://discord.gg/pwzPTvgfgz
Or
Select [Customer Service] on Steam, then [Contact Game Customer Service].

Thank you for your patience and support!
